# OIBSIP Python Programming Internship

## Task: BMI Calculator 

### Objective:
The objective of this task is to build a Python application that calculates Body Mass Index (BMI) using user input and displays the health category.

### Steps Performed:
- Collected user input (height and weight)
- Applied BMI formula
- Displayed BMI result with category
- Tested program with different inputs

### Tools & Technologies Used:
- Python
- PyCharm
- Basic Python libraries

### Outcome:
Successfully developed a working BMI calculator using Python. This project improved my understanding of user input, conditions, and Python logic building.
